0016C3  3               LAB_YEAR:
0016C3  3  A2 06                LDX     #RTCYEAR
0016C5  3  A9 33                LDA     #51
0016C7  3  85 32                STA     farfunct
0016C9  3  20 F0 FF             JSR     DO_FARCALL
0016CC  3  98                   TYA
